    {
      "id": "2108062258618048625",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-08T05:09:43.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 13:09:43",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Project Suncatcher is our moonshot exploring whether we can one day host machine learning infrastructure in space 🚀\n\nTo do so, we need to know whether our AI hardware can operate in orbit. Can our TPUs handle the physical stress of spaceflight and the radiation and thermal extremes of space? These are the questions Google researchers have been exploring for the past few years.\n\nLast week, we launched our first test satellite carrying four TPUs into orbit — putting us one step closer to getting answers.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {},
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2108062258618048625",
      "images": [],
      "media": [],
      "enriched": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2108062018490249347",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-08T05:08:45.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 13:08:45",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Awesome day, @satyanadella! \n\nWindows sparked a platform shift that created a new industry for NVIDIA. Then we invented programmable shading GPUs for DirectX, which led to CUDA. \n\nThen we partnered to bring GPU supercomputers to Azure, which helped OpenAI train GPT. That collaboration inspired us to reinvent Windows for the age of personal agents.\n\n4 years. Thousands of engineering years between us.\n\nSo proud of what we built together.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {},
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2108062018490249347",
      "images": [],
