      "text": "Huge differentiator for Grok @bot here because it'll give you access to search, read and monitor @X for free.\n\nSo one thing you can do is use @mvanhorn's Agent Tincan project (https://github.com/mvanhorn/agent-tincan) to get your other agents use your grok @bot for X functions if you prefer to use those day to day while not missing out on this.",
