      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Grok Bot is crazy, man. You can claim your email with literally one click. I just did it.\nAnd I also set up cross-channel communication between my Hermes Agent and Grok Bot. They can now hand off tasks and work with each other over email.\nThis is literally two different agents getting shit done for me now.",
