      "text": "Started out thinking I was gonna make a video on Dots and my issues with them, but kinda ended up just talking about \"personal assistant\" agents generally\n\nTL;DR: grok bot is the best one by far. Muse is good, but if ur reading this post it's not for u, and Dots needs work",
